"指定 ``*.json``\\ 。详见：\\ :ref:`tutorials/export/"
"exporting_projects:resource options`\\ 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"On Windows, this can also be due to :ref:`case sensitivity <tutorials/"
"best_practices/project_organization:Case sensitivity>` issues. If you "
"reference a resource in your script with a different case than on the "
"filesystem, loading will fail once you export the project. This is because "
"the virtual PCK filesystem is case-sensitive, while Windows's filesystem is "
"case-insensitive by default."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，也可能是\\ :ref:`大小写敏感性 <tutorials/best_practices/"
"project_organization:Case sensitivity>`\\ 的问题。如果你在脚本里引用资源时所"
"使用的大小写与文件系统中的不符，在导出项目后就会载入失败。这是因为虚拟 PCK 文"
"件系统是大小写敏感的，而 Windows 的文件系统是大小写不敏感的。"

